                <syllable xml:id="m-097538b8-a4d0-49d7-962b-c6675b4146fc">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-3e700cea-8f0e-4ffb-a0a0-630830522215" type="punctum" xml:id="m-46b7358f-f2c2-4ac8-877d-cfab81164335">
                    <nc xml:id="m-d230c0ca-f0a7-4be5-938a-14c7a122f1ce" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <custos xml:id="m-20b83bc4-918d-4bcb-baba-6a09b315f393" facs="#m-ff41cf98-8faf-4341-b9ce-226f71f106ef" pname="g" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-ed7f961b-2b2c-4fb5-a180-46e585be1503">
              <lg xml:id="m-fc1622aa-834b-4903-9739-f8f346e40e86">
                <l xml:id="m-2cf86a84-2338-4108-aeb5-113580d0e156" facs="#m-ce1d1014-0130-42ac-ae9d-db1eaa68fd5a" label="ambiguous">1280</l><l xml:id="m-f69bef52-ee7c-4ae6-b821-d8cde3b060a4" facs="#m-941094df-3647-4ba1-880f-b19162f8a773" label="text-like">Mass to beg for Peace.</l><l xml:id="m-d1b2311f-b682-4f48-90ee-2489d2c9f7ac" facs="#m-992f0d9b-d60b-4ded-81fa-db2be2aa4bde" label="ambiguous">da</l><l xml:id="m-8796684e-a4a2-4474-9078-39a78ac2c3bf" facs="#m-72631d2b-7547-487e-8ce1-cf7286199269" label="lyrics-like">Dé- um</l><l xml:id="m-47a93616-db4c-4427-a2c4-35cf0192fa11" facs="#m-feda2f33-7ea5-46ee-aa9d-0f8b180f7f86" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum: láu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5588aaf7-827f-4ecf-a26b-5dd5a5c19a6b" facs="#m-7a78f1cd-53e6-4376-a4b7-3404af7a19df" label="lyrics-like">Je-rú-sa-lem,</l><l xml:id="m-51fe1c0a-c3b4-44e3-93fa-ead823201de1" facs="#m-8e7fa8d8-efe4-4a3a-abf4-eee7b33a763f" label="lyrics-like">tú- um, “Sí- on.</l><l xml:id="m-892a15b1-0cbe-441b-be53-6de87a0e450a" facs="#m-e7d1f150-76d7-4e3b-844d-303fd2fdb398" label="lyrics-like">After Septuagesima, the following Tract is said instead of the Allelúia. and</l><l xml:id="m-d477b730-c5ae-4c0c-8f30-e3c4e2d33db8" facs="#m-abc751cc-3806-4f3b-979f-c6a052fe0563" label="ambiguous">its Verse:</l><l xml:id="m-5889c7b9-7992-4f76-93bd-537dcc5b4140" facs="#m-0ae72c63-1199-4d0e-91da-5fe584feba3e" label="ambiguous">Tract.</l><l xml:id="m-a82bb9b9-00ca-4e93-af3d-766f34834d2b" facs="#m-20ee898d-a07f-4f82-a51e-535937474bb9" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-5a02ec43-f983-4db1-bf4b-3df75a013cb2" facs="#m-9e07c6bb-df69-4250-a97f-079a7bd70dfc" label="ambiguous">D o tus</l><l xml:id="m-a3f29fad-6006-4b4a-a4e6-04c05fa43b9b" facs="#m-dbf0aebc-15eb-4ed7-804d-d5b948752f7b" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-97c0dbe6-91a0-4373-adfe-ee65c0ef18cc" facs="#m-6efebd3f-cbd9-4271-ad44-80fb88ddceaf" label="lyrics-like">*in Judaé-a</l><l xml:id="m-59280dbb-c23c-4f9c-8899-80bc4f1cf52c" facs="#m-6b386f92-891a-4e48-9892-6ef2fed2080d" label="ambiguous">in Is¬</l><l xml:id="m-26a5fe5e-86f3-4d2a-8cea-0ba5c1d3c034" facs="#m-875dcf69-909e-4ace-9a7b-f13aac57a4d1" label="ambiguous">us,</l><l xml:id="m-9b5c3ccb-9db0-4990-a716-88fe36bdecd7" facs="#m-244e170a-1946-4869-ba31-4c624c7b291f" label="lyrics-like">má-gnum nómen é¬</l><l xml:id="m-353150ac-105a-48e1-92de-a97d26c897c3" facs="#m-8617b0e1-05a8-4777-abdf-d3d0a1c9cb97" label="ambiguous">ra-el</l><l xml:id="m-dea6f79d-1565-47e1-a62b-8aa5cf7f8eea" facs="#m-00951ea0-c321-4837-b4b2-0327c76f7750" label="lyrics-like">jus. V. Et fá-ctus est in pá¬ ce ló-cus é¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c789950-002a-44cf-8b1f-7ed8d302edd1" facs="#m-d7bfe939-d5c2-4478-a994-8b45dd3bc739" label="lyrics-like">jus, et habi-tá¬ ti-o</l><l xml:id="m-db771652-d420-4f3d-997b-1e90bf1e7381" facs="#m-6f9d8e5b-7b18-43de-9387-c31eebfeba8e" label="ambiguous">jus in Si-on.</l><l xml:id="m-43a623f6-8d2a-48bd-b6e7-d838df628860" facs="#m-21711c36-a449-452e-8ada-860c27dbd59b" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-dba9d0cc-008e-40f8-a9d4-50e67010d7ca" facs="#m-4c60fa1f-215a-488f-8846-a5d86e392833" label="lyrics-like">V. Ibi confré¬</l><l xml:id="m-66e7fdf9-ef14-4552-a48b-949e2290c40a" facs="#m-5a1e281e-5223-4717-bc85-33d04e4716ac" label="lyrics-like">git pot-én-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-e15e59c0-fbae-434f-a367-8793d41e0b48" facs="#m-40749b01-a524-42d0-a935-87a905cbaf7f" label="lyrics-like">tum, glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f245a3d3-6374-4163-9817-ea4a1595d4ec" facs="#m-1c385d1d-4a77-47ff-a8e3-e5dee2849b11" label="lyrics-like">árcu-um, scú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1fddf733-e17f-4f0a-af80-66f73d77aadb" facs="#m-b332a1be-1b03-4f95-9289-24f412ba7664" label="ambiguous">as</l><l xml:id="m-2cc1b14b-3441-4f34-8a37-61cb62c86186" facs="#m-75724937-1693-462a-a6a4-cc969f51e80a" label="lyrics-like">di- um, * et béllum.</l><l xml:id="m-0a7ff88a-3108-46e4-b730-d60928defc8e" facs="#m-490a3399-50b1-415f-8fa4-fd0d0977faea" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Alleluia, alleluia. Y. Lánda</l><l xml:id="m-83ddc57f-e90f-4176-b413-acdf242ba0c0" facs="#m-2a3080e7-c7df-4f8a-8979-dde7c4fdbfc8" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem. is sung instead, p. 1285; and then the following:</l><l xml:id="m-30b0f54c-23af-4a51-af28-3509a29f0f18" facs="#m-7aa60f1d-106b-4621-8606-040134cf7f1f" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-f13b60c7-2db2-4343-a6fe-02b59d99ce5f" facs="#m-f6ce2e71-20b3-4271-abe5-29aa7e7ca969" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-9be81a95-9f89-4e0b-9865-f208d049fcf9" facs="#m-2b7c2a3f-fc81-40b4-aff8-2bfba090b6f9" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui pó-su¬</l><l xml:id="m-63fb3829-df0e-499c-b5f1-36d3846d81e8" facs="#m-fa450acb-335e-433d-974b-f38c7399c3bd" label="lyrics-like">L-le-lú¬ ia</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
